{"id":"MOEX-112100-1301-Q075","title":"Uncompetitive反競爭性抑制：Vmax、Km同降","version":"v4","batch":"112-2-med1-q51-100","sourceSha256":"f85260e5cbcd7d3ee709b47fde5baa7d0b9b1a5b5ba65d5fba7b782f3b93e24e","shortHtml":"<p>原題中文寫「非競爭性」，但英文為<strong>uncompetitive inhibitor</strong>，本題應按<strong>反競爭性抑制</strong>判讀；它與英文<strong>noncompetitive（非競爭性）</strong>不同。官方A：<strong>最大反應速率Vmax下降、表觀米氏常數Km下降</strong>，符合uncompetitive的動力學。</p>","html":"<h2>Uncompetitive反競爭性抑制：Vmax、Km同降</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：A</p><h3>先核英文：本題是uncompetitive，答案A</h3>\n<p>原題中文寫「非競爭性」，但英文為<strong>uncompetitive inhibitor</strong>，本題應按<strong>反競爭性抑制</strong>判讀；它與英文<strong>noncompetitive（非競爭性）</strong>不同。官方A：<strong>最大反應速率Vmax下降、表觀米氏常數Km下降</strong>，符合uncompetitive的動力學。</p>\n<h3>只抓住已與受質結合的酵素</h3>\n<p>以<strong>E代表酵素、S代表受質、I代表抑制劑</strong>：E先與S形成<strong>ES複合體</strong>，I才結合ES成為不產生產物的ESI；在純uncompetitive模型中，I不與游離E結合。</p>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:799px;--reviewed-image-ratio:3.049618320610687\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/76e5a53a61b0df29e788cbce81e2aebfb2603e47af5972759b364a1c752e29d5.jpg\" alt=\"正常受質先結合酵素，再由反競爭性抑制劑結合酵素受質複合體\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"799\" height=\"262\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/76e5a53a61b0df29e788cbce81e2aebfb2603e47af5972759b364a1c752e29d5.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>黃色為受質，紫色抑制劑加入時酵素已帶受質；這是「只結合ES」的示意，不表示所有抑制劑都有相同形狀或口袋。Aleia Kim／Biochemistry Free For All Figure4.40，CC BY-NC-SA 4.0。</figcaption></figure>\n<p>抑制劑把部分ES困在ESI，減少能完成催化循環的有效酵素，所以<strong>最大反應速率Vmax降低</strong>。同時表觀Km也降低；這是整個反應系統的動力學變化，<strong>不能直接等同游離E與S的結合常數真的改變</strong>。</p>\n<h3>同一倍數下降，雙倒數圖就是平行線</h3>\n<p>令α′＝1＋[I]／Ki′，其中Ki′為I與ES結合的抑制常數，則<strong>Vmax,app＝Vmax／α′；Km,app＝Km／α′</strong>。兩者同除以α′，故Lineweaver–Burk<strong>雙倒數圖斜率Km／Vmax不變</strong>。</p>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:2444px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.5626598465473145\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/6077fd0c9300eeed171ac27b03277b850c47c532b52be2699004d2cea3a60f92.png\" alt=\"反競爭性抑制劑增加時，Lineweaver Burk雙倒數圖為向左上平移的平行線\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2444\" height=\"1564\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/6077fd0c9300eeed171ac27b03277b850c47c532b52be2699004d2cea3a60f92.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>縱截距1／Vmax增加，橫截距−1／Km更負，線條保持平行；Increasing inhibitor代表抑制劑增加。TimVickers，作者釋出公有領域。</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>純型抑制模型</th><th>Vmax</th><th>表觀Km</th><th>典型結合對象</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Competitive，競爭性</td><td>不變</td><td>上升</td><td>游離E</td></tr><tr><td>Noncompetitive，純非競爭性</td><td>下降</td><td>不變</td><td>對E與ES親和力相同</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Uncompetitive，反競爭性</strong></td><td><strong>下降</strong></td><td><strong>下降</strong></td><td><strong>只結合ES</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>不要套用「增加受質就能克服」的競爭性口訣：uncompetitive需要ES才有結合標的，提高S仍不能恢復原本的Vmax。實際混合型抑制則可能有不同Km變化，不能把所有非活性位抑制都當成同一純型。</p><details><summary>原題、答鍵與圖文查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部正式原題（卷碼1301）</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?code=112100&amp;t=A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2023-09-05更正清冊：本科無更正紀錄</a></li><li><a href=\"https://bio.libretexts.org/Bookshelves/Biochemistry/Book%3A_Biochemistry_Free_For_All_(Ahern_Rajagopal_and_Tan)/04%3A_Catalysis/4.02%3A_Control_of_Enzymatic_Activity\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ahern／Rajagopal／Tan：uncompetitive與Figure4.40，NC-SA4.0</a></li><li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Uncompetitive_inhibition.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TimVickers：平行雙倒數線，公有領域</a></li></ul></details>","imageCount":2,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：A"}